# --- prd/: included, sanitized ---
# The 4 Follow-Up Finder PRDs originally named real colleagues and real
# partner deals (an MNDA follow-up, a partner deck review). Copied in with
# those names substituted for fictional stand-ins (see each file's own note
# under its frontmatter) rather than excluded outright, since the design
# reasoning itself is worth keeping in version control.

# --- resources/: mostly excluded for the same reason ---
# The test/validation reports in this folder are dry runs and control-test
# comparisons against Art's real Slack/Gmail/Calendar activity — they quote
# real messages, real timestamps, and real colleagues'/partners' names.
# Only the one file that's pure logic (no real names) is included below.
resources/*
!resources/2026-09-14-follow-up-finder-core-rules.md

